    "body": "Updates `virtualenv` to 21.7.16 to address PYSEC-2026-4011, PYSEC-2026-4012, PYSEC-2026-4013, PYSEC-2026-4014 (CVE-2026-102925, CVE-2026-102930, CVE-2026-102937).\n\nEvidence:\n- `pyproject.toml` pinned `virtualenv==21.2.0`\n- `pip-audit` reports the four PYSEC entries above for that version\n- updated version: `21.7.16` (first release clearing all four; clean on OSV)\n\nValidation:\n- `pip-audit -r` with the new pin reports no known vulnerabilities\n- `pip install virtualenv==21.7.16` installs and imports cleanly\n- `requires-python = \">=3.10\"` satisfied by the new pin\n\nScope: dependency pin update only (`pyproject.toml`).\n",
    "changed_files": 1,
